1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
El Gran Carlemany, mon pare,

2
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,000
Dels alarbs em deslliurà,

3
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:20,000
I del cel vida em donà,

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,100
De Meritxell, la gran Mare.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:28,000
Princesa nasquí i pubilla

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:32,000
Entre dos nacions, neutral;

7
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,100
Sols resto l'única filla,

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,000
De l'imperi Carlemany.

9
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:45,000
Creient i lliure onze segles,

10
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:50,000
Creient i lliure vull ser.

11
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:57,400
Siguin els furs mos tutors

12
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:04,000
I mos Prínceps defensors!